@ECHO OFF
REM RUNALL - run every w9xfix self-test; each writes OUT\T*.TXT, failures are noted in OUT\RUNALL.TXT
IF NOT EXIST OUT\NUL MD OUT
ECHO W9XTEST run > OUT\RUNALL.TXT
W9XFIX -q -l OUT\RUNALL.TXT show > NUL
CALL T1SHOW.BAT
CALL T2ASPM.BAT
CALL T3EHCI.BAT
CALL T4INTX.BAT
CALL T5ROUTE.BAT
CALL T6CHECK.BAT
CALL T7LOG.BAT
ECHO RUNALL done >> OUT\RUNALL.TXT
ECHO.
ECHO Done. Results in OUT\ - bring the directory back. Notes/failures:
TYPE OUT\RUNALL.TXT
DIR OUT /B
